        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "These responses came from IT organizations in public sectors, such as IT centers in universities, ministries and institutions as well as from major IT companies in the Kingdom. Respondents also were kindly asked to resend the survey hyperlink to their colleagues working in the IT sector. Further details about the study sample are presented in the sample section.",
