        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "As mentioned previously, the questionnaire was distributed by e-mail to people who work in information technology organizations in the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia. A total of 171 completed surveys were received and used for analysis. Seventy-three percent of respondents were male and the majority of the respondents were aged between 20 and 35 years old. Table 3 shows a descriptive analysis of sample characteristics.",
